  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AgDevCo Ventures - targeting early-stage enterprises in the agriculture sector to scale up activities</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Programme design funds and investment capital for AgDevCo&#x2019;s Venture Plus initiative which will target early-stage small and medium sized enterprises in the agriculture sector requiring between $1m and $4m to scale-up their activities. 

AgDevCo is a specialised investor and project developer focused exclusively on early stage agribusiness in Africa. AgDevCo deploys patient capital and technical assistance to build profitable businesses that contribute to food security, drive economic growth and create jobs and income in rural areas and contribute to farmers&#x2019; resilience to climate change.</narrative>
  </description>
